{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JHH8KMUnYWAN7b1fTToNnc","type":"tool_result","content":"# loanly\n\nFlutter app (iOS + Android). Two UI shells ship at the moment:\n\n- `lib/legacy_app.dart` — the old UI, still used by ~30% of users\n  (`--dart-define=NEW_UI=false` in the release pipeline for the A/B group).\n- `lib/new_app.dart` — the redesigned UI with go_router (default).\n\nAnalytics: PostHog (`posthog_flutter`). Events, screen tracking and session\nreplay are enabled in `lib/analytics.dart`; \"Record user sessions\" is on in\nthe PostHog project settings, sampling 100%.\n\n```\nflutter run --dart-define=NEW_UI=true\nflutter run --dart-define=NEW_UI=false\n```\nname: loanly\ndescription: Loan calculator and application flow.\npublish_to: \"none\"\nversion: 2.4.0+61\n\nenvironment:\n  sdk: ^3.5.0\n\ndependencies:\n  flutter:\n    sdk: flutter\n  go_router: ^14.6.2\n  posthog_flutter: ^5.36.0\n\ndev_dependencies:\n  flutter_test:\n    sdk: flutter\n  flutter_lints: ^5.0.0\n\nflutter:\n  uses-material-design: true\ninclude: package:flutter_lints/flutter.yaml\nlib/analytics.dart\nlib/legacy_app.dart\nlib/main.dart\nlib/new_app.dart\nlib/screens/application_screen.dart\nlib/screens/calculator_screen.dart\nlib/screens/offers_screen.dart\n11","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d3e02be2-34ff-428f-8cae-a0bfa18013c6","uuid":"1710e94c-2e77-4d2c-979d-e8308fe2b7c8","timestamp":"2026-10-19T02:49:35.508Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# loanly\n\nFlutter app (iOS + Android). Two UI shells ship at the moment:\n\n- `lib/legacy_app.dart` — the old UI, still used by ~30% of users\n  (`--dart-define=NEW_UI=false` in the release pipeline for the A/B group).\n- `lib/new_app.dart` — the redesigned UI with go_router (default).\n\nAnalytics: PostHog (`posthog_flutter`). Events, screen tracking and session\nreplay are enabled in `lib/analytics.dart`; \"Record user sessions\" is on in\nthe PostHog project settings, sampling